			"notes": "The long awaited v1.19 release is here!\n\n__Changelog__\n- Added a new option \"Use Affixes\" to enable / disable prefixes and suffixes\n- (Hopefully) fixed desync issues with config serialization and deserialization\n- \"Forked\" MaowImpl/owo from the abyss since MaowImpl seems to have deleted their account\n   - MaowImpl-owo is now built with UTF-8, which should hopefully fix the misencoded text issues. If you still end up getting weird text please open a Github issue!\n   - Updated to MaowImpl-owo v2, which changes a few specifics of this mod's API\n\nNote that because of the changes 1.19 made to chat signing, all owofied messages will show up as unsigned messages - you may need to disable the option that filters out unsigned messages in order to see owofied messages. Properly signing owofied messages would require a client-side mod, but Hewo is currently designed to work with only a server-side mod."
		},
